cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic or research work, please cite it as below."
title: snapfeed
abstract: >-
  One-tap feedback widget for internal dogfooding. Open-source TypeScript / React
  library that captures feedback, screenshots, voice, and screen recordings from
  testers, employees, and beta users, then routes them to bug-tracking and
  team-chat destinations. Self-hosted, MIT-licensed, with optional bring-your-own-key
  GenAI features for title generation, severity inference, and deduplication.
type: software
authors:
